------- 10 th Aug 2026 ---------------
Architecture review

At this point your Document Intelligence stack is well structured:

                Upload
                  │
                  ▼
           StorageService
                  │
                  ▼
        DocumentProcessingService
                  │
      ┌───────────┴────────────┐
      ▼                        ▼
ProcessorFactory          TextChunker
      │                        │
      ▼                        ▼
DocumentContent ─────────► Chunks

The responsibilities are cleanly separated:
    Processors normalize documents into DocumentContent.
    Chunkers split normalized content into reusable chunks.
    DocumentProcessingService orchestrates the workflow.
    No layer has unnecessary knowledge of another's implementation.

This is exactly the kind of separation that will support future AI features.
